{
 "encounter_id": "00664",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CLINICAL_STAFF"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right, I've got my notes. My hands have been swelling for two weeks and my rings won't come off, and I'm twenty-eight weeks, so I wanted it looked at."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good call. Tell me about the swelling, is it both hands?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Both, worse in the morning. I also get puffy ankles by the evening, that's been about a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What about headaches?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Most afternoons, a band across the front. I wrote them down, five days out of the last seven."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Heartburn, mainly at night, and a bit of backache. Nothing unusual for this stage, I'd have thought."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blurred vision or flashing lights?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my vision's been normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pain under the ribs on the right?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any bleeding?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No bleeding at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any fluid leaking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing's leaked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What tablets are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ferrous sulfate, 200 mg, once a day. A low-dose aspirin, maybe 75 mg? I'd need to check. And a little orange capsule, I can't remember what it's called, my midwife said it's for my bones."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. We'll note the orange capsule as you describe it. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Latex. I get an itchy rash from the gloves."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, I'll tell the team. Any medical conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Asthma, since I was a teenager. And migraines, but those have been quiet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Previous operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A caesarean, three years ago, with my first."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pregnancy problems in your family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mum had pre-eclampsia with me. That's what's worrying me, honestly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's useful. What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a primary school teacher. On my feet most of the day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've never smoked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I haven't had a drink since I found out."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Can I take your numbers?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Sorry to interrupt, doctor, I've got the blood pressure cuff ready. Pop it on the left arm, Priya.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. Your blood pressure is 138 over 88, pulse 84, temperature 36.7, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 18, weight 71 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the pressure high? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's a little up for you, so I want to be careful. Let me look at your hands. They're puffy, pitting at the fingers.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's what the rings are doing. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the ankles look swollen on both sides."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, they get worse by evening. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, it's fine, even with the asthma."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This could be early pre-eclampsia, but I wouldn't want to call it yet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What do I do about that? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to test your urine for protein, and arrange blood tests including liver function and platelets."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can take the urine sample now if you like. The toilet's just down the hall. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sure, thanks. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like an ultrasound scan of the baby's growth."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When would the scan be? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Within the next few days. Reception will phone you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "We'll book it before you leave. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in a week, sooner if you get a bad headache or your vision changes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A week. Okay, I'll be here. ~"
  }
 ],
